{
  "version": 1,
  "names": {
    "hermit": "The Hermit",
    "keeper": "The Candle-Keeper"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "hermit-hello",
      "speaker": "hermit",
      "lines": [
        "Another one wakes in the dark.",
        "The way on climbs a wall too tall for you. Turn back first: something waits behind you."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "Who are you?",
          "to": "hermit-who"
        },
        {
          "label": "What waits?",
          "to": "hermit-wings"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hermit-who",
      "speaker": "hermit",
      "lines": [
        "Only a hermit. I came for the bell and stayed for the dark.",
        "Rest at the altars. They keep your place when you fall."
      ],
      "choices": [],
      "set": {
        "met-hermit": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hermit-wings",
      "speaker": "hermit",
      "lines": [
        "Wings, of a sort. The dead took them down and forgot them.",
        "With them, that tall step is nothing."
      ],
      "choices": [],
      "set": {
        "met-hermit": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "hermit-again",
      "speaker": "hermit",
      "lines": [
        "Still here. The dark is patient, and so am I."
      ],
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "keeper-hello",
      "speaker": "keeper",
      "lines": [
        "I keep the candles for those who pass.",
        "Past the chasm the Headsman kneels over his cleaver. He waits for anyone who would leave."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "How is he beaten?",
          "to": "keeper-how"
        },
        {
          "label": "Pray for me.",
          "to": "keeper-pray",
          "set": {
            "prayed": true
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "keeper-how",
      "speaker": "keeper",
      "lines": [
        "Watch the cleaver rise. Turn it aside as it falls, then strike while he reels.",
        "When he roars he is half beaten, and angrier for it."
      ],
      "choices": [],
      "set": {
        "met-keeper": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "keeper-pray",
      "speaker": "keeper",
      "lines": [
        "Then go with the light.",
        "A candle burns for you now."
      ],
      "choices": [],
      "set": {
        "met-keeper": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "keeper-again",
      "speaker": "keeper",
      "lines": [
        "Your candle still burns."
      ],
      "choices": []
    }
  ],
  "starts": [
    {
      "speaker": "hermit",
      "node": "hermit-again",
      "when": [
        {
          "flag": "met-hermit",
          "is": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "hermit",
      "node": "hermit-hello"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "keeper",
      "node": "keeper-again",
      "when": [
        {
          "flag": "met-keeper",
          "is": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "keeper",
      "node": "keeper-hello"
    }
  ]
}
